      "course": {
        "code": "MS2A-MLP-2026",
        "description": "A 33-hour applied machine learning course in eleven 3-hour sessions, taken\nafter *Python AI Engineering*. It walks the full arc of a modern ML system:\ncollecting and preparing data, tabular models, deep networks in PyTorch,\ncomputer vision, natural language processing and large language models,\nreinforcement learning, and deploying a trained model as a Docker image\nserved by an API.\n\nEvery session is half lecture, half lab. Half the grade is a project\nsubmitted to ML-Arena; the other half is continuous assessment across the\neleven labs. You are expected to arrive with the engineering floor from the\n12-hour module: git, a packaged environment, tests, and a coding agent you\nknow how to supervise.",
